]X3f4781b clopidogrel bisulfate: cell volume ~1852 A3 with MW420. Z=4 (density1.5), not Z=2 (density0.75). In P21 MUST use Z'=2: two clopidogrel cations and two bisulfates. The first MC trial had Z'=1 and was necessarily incorrect; do not submit its structure.
X9af54a2 P21 volume1407 Z=4 Z'=2.
X3c176e2 P212121 volume1444 Z=8 Z'=2.
Xd4c1a35 P212121 volume3426 Z=8 Z'=2.
X4f6fe58 P-1 volume1410 Z=4 Z'=2.
X3c176e2 inositol isomer0 (RDKit enumeration) with Z'=2 P212121 solved, Rwp0.04247, minO-contact2.532 A, bonds1.413-1.563 A; submitted.
Xe3a2935 final Rwp0.09778 vs Le Bail0.0869; plausible heavy connectivity, 2.80A mincontacts; submitted.
Xfca9f3c best cell candidate1/P21 newly submitted JSON after freshbase0.03974.
X8a06d7a partial TRI log gives M47.37 V1300.7 a5.061,b11.862,c21.748,angles93.96,91.916,92.17; fits in progress for five candidates.
Antibump test: ObjCryst DOES count intramolecular bonds! New script antibump.py assigns topology-aware minima only with separate atom scattering powers (--fullbump), or solvent/ion selective only (--bump). Scale via c.XMLInput(XMLOutput modified AntiBumpScale). Usual scale10; rescale diffraction errors before search (--rescale) for comparable chemical likelihood.
IMPORTANT: automatic MonteCarlo LSQ after each run was causing very large geometry likelihood and nonphysical high-cost models in X130/X35. Default MC_LSQ now 0 (never); only enable explicitly if useful. Added --profile for full point-by-point MC when integrated-profile objective is suspicious.
IMPORTANT: Molecule internal-coordinate translation is a gauge mode. Least squares (especially --rigid starting models) can drift its common XYZ center to 1e9 A; CIF calc remains correct but ObjCryst XML six-significant-digit serialization collapses the molecule! Added recenter_molecules() before CIF/XML saving and each refinement cycle. X3c176e2 refined_10.xml was corrupted this way, but original CIF fine; restored via restore_cif.py and highres fit 0.03704, re-submitted.
IMPORTANT: c.XMLInput on a crystal already containing Python-owned Molecules can abort with invalid pointer. antibump.py now leaves default AntiBumpScale1, does not use XMLInput. --fullbump sameatom SP distances still work without scaling.
X35b7fbc likely ergometrine maleate. Default unspecified C=C conformer was TRANS, cannot change under rigid double-bond restraint. Now cis.json/trans.json enumerate. Stopped trans search after ~4M; new cis search scheduled.
Four original submitted structures replaced by higher-resolution dmin1.316A refinements: Xe3 Rwp.07252, Xf8.08811, Xbfc.03502, X078.12342; all connectivity/contact checks passed.
Xeb393f9 triclinic cell V~682, M72.29, whole-profile Lebail.0454. Enantiopure one FU has density1.33 with Z1, thus P1 plausible; freshbase/JSON submitted. Candidate reducedcell8.014,9.816,10.233 angles74.871,68.959,65.931.
X14a2b08 candidate4 is markedly better (Lebail.0838 vs .109 others), freshbase/JSON replaces candidate0. X8a06d7a cell4 tentative (best prior.125 but fresh.146); raw-peak reindex needed.

Continuation: ObjCryst bridge compiled in /app/work/libobj_bridge.so with wrapper obj_bridge.py.
Exact fixed-profile Pawley matrix now implemented and GALLOP preparation uses exact weighted profile overlaps and SVD extraction (old gallop runs remain old).
Anti-bump scale safely adjustable via bridge (no XMLInput); current antibump.py respects requested scale, default10.
Aromatic N-aroyl amide torsion restraints disabled in new model generation (e.g. acemetacin) because truly rotatable.
Xd4 run1 was killed (bad older base Le Bail .228). Fresh base .09397 saved and run2/full-profile started on new CoreC queue.
X130 run2 refined to .0875 but cocrystal molecules overlap/connect; not submitted.
Xfca all-trans run10 refined to .04652; validated two26-heavy molecules; submitted six-th CIF. High-resolution refinement planned.
X7e reconsidered: candidate V324 ignored clearly crystalline first2.808° peak (and5.635°,11.301° harmonics). Doubling c toV647 permits first001, full-profile .03496 vs .04522 half-cell. Half-anion global solver plateau ~202 normalized cost /Rwp.096, likely half-cell is only pseudosubcell. Replaced mainbase with fit_double0.xml (.32, not inferior fresh doublebase), and JSON with doubledcell. Fullanion+2N Zprime1 P-1 GALLOP21 queued. Half oldbase remains half_base/.
